{"candidate_id":"MM-007-016","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":7,"lecture_title":"урок 06","topic":"range_boundary","scenario":"lower_boundary_formation","claim_type":"mechanism","tags":["risk"],"primary_tag":"risk","statement":"Нижняя граница канала может сформироваться там, где крупный покупатель выставляет/исполняет достаточно большой объем, чтобы продавцы не смогли продавить цену ниже; после остановки падения и отскока появляется рабочий канал.","quote":"Появился крупный покупатель, который выставил большой ордер, не пускай ниже... отсюда и начинается канал накопления.","interpretation":"Boundary origin is tied to absorption/static defense, not arbitrary horizontal drawing.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:59:25-01:03:55","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_007_a8120ad5","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_007_urok_06/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0133","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0134","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0135","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0136","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0137","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0138","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0139","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0140","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0141","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0142"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00078.jpg","time":"01:00:48"},{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00079.jpg","time":"01:01:48"},{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00080.jpg","time":"01:02:48"}],"source_unit_count":10,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-007-017","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":7,"lecture_title":"урок 06","topic":"range_defense","scenario":"lower_boundary_defense","claim_type":"principle","tags":["false_breakout","levels"],"primary_tag":"false_breakout","statement":"Крупному игроку невыгодно выпускать цену глубоко ниже нижней границы, потому что там может начаться паника и поток продаж, который он уже не сможет удержать без больших потерь.","quote":"Мы не хотим, чтобы цена валилась ниже 70 глубоко... там уже будет продолжение падения... мы не сможем удержать такую толпу продавцов.","interpretation":"False breakdown depth must remain controllable; uncontrolled break invalidates accumulation defense.","confidence":0.86,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:03:55-01:06:18","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_007_a8120ad5","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_007_urok_06/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0143","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0144","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0145","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0146","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0147","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0148"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00083.jpg","time":"01:05:48"}],"source_unit_count":6,"source_frame_count":1,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-007-018","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":7,"lecture_title":"урок 06","topic":"false_breakout","scenario":"range_accumulation","claim_type":"mechanism","tags":["breakout","exit","false_breakout","retest","risk","saw"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"Ложный выход за нижнюю границу может быть способом собрать ликвидность: крупный игрок слегка выпускает цену ниже, провоцирует панические продажи, выкупает их и рыночными покупками возвращает цену обратно в канал.","quote":"Сделали ложный выход для того, чтобы кто-то начал продавать... мы выкупили то, что этот паникер начал продавать... и потом опять нажали купить по рынку.","interpretation":"False break inside accumulation is treated as liquidity harvesting by the range defender.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:06:58-01:09:39","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_007_a8120ad5","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_007_urok_06/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0149","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0150","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0151","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0152","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0153","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0154"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00083.jpg","time":"01:05:48"},{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00087.jpg","time":"01:09:42"}],"source_unit_count":6,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-007-019","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":7,"lecture_title":"урок 06","topic":"range_defense","scenario":"upper_boundary_defense","claim_type":"mechanism","tags":["risk","timeframes"],"primary_tag":"risk","statement":"Для удержания верхней границы крупный игрок может продать по рынку небольшую часть уже накопленного объема, чтобы поглотить ближайшие bid-заявки и вернуть цену внутрь канала; такие тактические потери допустимы ради сохранения средней цены и плана накопления.","quote":"Продав 5 штук по рынку, мы продадим и двинем цену вниз, тем самым не пустив выше... иногда крупняк в этом процессе, в моменте он будет терять.","interpretation":"Range defense can use both market sells near upper boundary and market buys near lower boundary.","confidence":0.86,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:09:39-01:16:52","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_007_a8120ad5","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_007_urok_06/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0155","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0156","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0157","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0158","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0159","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0160","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0161","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0164","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0166","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0169","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0171","lec_007_a8120ad5_seg_0175"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00087.jpg","time":"01:09:42"},{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00092.jpg","time":"01:14:42"},{"path":"урок 06/frames/frame_00094.jpg","time":"01:16:42"}],"source_unit_count":12,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":5,"support_gap_ids":["LEGACY-GAP-007-015","LEGACY-GAP-007-016","LEGACY-GAP-007-017","LEGACY-GAP-007-018","LEGACY-GAP-007-019"],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","exec