{"candidate_id":"MM-008-013","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"atr","scenario":"breakout_distance_to_level","claim_type":"principle","tags":["atr_room","breakout","levels","trend_context"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Качество пробоя зависит от расстояния от вчерашнего закрытия до уровня: если до уровня примерно целый ATR, цена потратит запас хода только на подход; если новый день стартует рядом с уровнем и тратит около 20% ATR на подход, пробой имеет больше шансов на продолжение.","quote":"Расстояние от вчерашнего закрытия до уровня целый АТР... дойдя сюда, он уже пройдет свой бензин... чтобы дойти до уровня, он пройдет максимум 20% своего АТАРа.","interpretation":"Breakout setup should measure ATR spent before the level, not only distance after the breakout.","confidence":0.9,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:47:53-00:52:11","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0103","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0104","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0105","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0106","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0107","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0108","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0109","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0110","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0111","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0112"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00066.jpg","time":"00:48:50"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00067.jpg","time":"00:49:50"}],"source_unit_count":10,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
