{"candidate_id":"MM-008-018","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"trade_management","scenario":"level_target_exit","claim_type":"principle","tags":["breakout","exit","false_breakout","levels","risk","timeframes"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"При движении от уровня к уровню сделку можно закрывать у целевого уровня, не ожидая заранее, что обязательно появится ложный пробой и дополнительный ход; если цена возвращается под уровень, картинка ломается.","quote":"Когда дошли до уровня, я закрылся. Я не знаю, будет ли ложный пробой... если начнет возвращаться обратно цена под уровень, я продам.","interpretation":"Level target management is prioritized over guessing an unconfirmed extension.","confidence":0.86,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:05:24-01:08:22","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0144","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0145","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0146","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0147","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0148","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0149","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0150"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00086.jpg","time":"01:05:24"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00091.jpg","time":"01:07:00"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00092.jpg","time":"01:08:14"}],"source_unit_count":7,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-019","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"atr","scenario":"atr_zero_point","claim_type":"definition","tags":["atr_room","entry","levels","market_selection"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Нулевая точка ATR - это закрытие вчерашнего дня; на криптовалюте открытие нового дня обычно совпадает с прошлым закрытием, а на американском рынке возможен gap между закрытием и открытием.","quote":"Точка 0 - это закрытие вчерашнего дня... на криптовалюте... закрывается прошлый день, и тут же открывается следующий... на рынке Америки... может открыться цена с гэпом.","interpretation":"ATR progress for the day is anchored to previous close rather than arbitrary intraday entry point.","confidence":0.9,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:08:11-01:11:08","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0151","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0152","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0153","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0154","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0155","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0156"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00095.jpg","time":"01:09:44"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00097.jpg","time":"01:11:44"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00102.jpg","time":"01:17:22"}],"source_unit_count":6,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-020","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"gap","scenario":"atr_gap_counting","claim_type":"principle","tags":["atr_room","entry","no_trade","timeframes"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Gap от вчерашнего закрытия до сегодняшнего открытия уже считается пройденной частью ATR; нельзя заново считать весь дневной ATR от цены открытия, потому что часть запаса хода уже потрачена.","quote":"Открылись по цене 10.05. Уже прошли 5 центов... это входит в часть пройденного АТАРа.","interpretation":"Gap consumes daily movement budget before regular-session trade decision.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:11:08-01:16:21","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0157","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0158","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0159","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0160","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0161","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0162","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0163","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0164","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0165"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00097.jpg","time":"01:11:44"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00098.jpg","time":"01:13:10"}],"source_unit_count":9,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-021","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"atr","scenario":"return_to_zero","claim_type":"principle","tags":["atr_room","exit","levels","retest"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Если цена прошла ATR в одну сторону, вернулась к нулевой точке вчерашнего закрытия и день еще не закрылся, от этой нулевой точки снова остается потенциальный полный ATR в другую сторону; такой итоговый двухсторонний день затем считается паранормальным и не используется как обычный ATR-бар.","quote":"Вернулись в точку ноль... у него есть запас хода пройти целый отар в другую сторону... этот бар будет просто паранормальный... в будущем в счет АТАРа не будет браться.","interpretation":"ATR budget is directional around previous close within the day, while final extreme range is excluded from future normal ATR calculation.","confidence":0.84,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:16:23-01:18:57","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0166","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0167","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0168","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0169","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0170","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0171","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0172","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0173","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0174"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00101.jpg","time":"01:16:10"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00102.jpg","time":"01:17:22"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00103.jpg","time":"01:18:08"}],"source_unit_count":9,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-022","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"volume_profile","scenario":"range_volume_distribution","claim_type":"principle","tags":["levels","risk","volatility"],"primary_tag":"levels","statement":"Volume profile не предсказывает будущее направление, а показывает, по каким ценам был проторгован наибольший объем; внутри канала основной объем обычно в середине, а у границ объем затухает, что помогает ориентировочно видеть границы диапазона.","quote":"Ни один индикатор никогда не покажет будущее... этот индикатор показывает именно объем... В середине канала всегда сосредоточен самый большой объем.","interpretation":"Volume profile is descriptive structural evidence, not standalone predictive signal.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:19:36-01:25:10","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0175","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0176","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0177","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0178","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0179","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0180","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0181","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0182","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0183","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0184","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0185"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00106.jpg","time":"01:19:43"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00108.jpg","time":"01:21:53"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00110.jpg","time":"01:23:47"}],"source_unit_count":11,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-023","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"volume_profile","scenario":"indicator_limitations","claim_type":"principle","tags":["entry","levels","risk"],"primary_tag":"entry","statement":"Уровни не нужно проводить только по volume profile, потому что индикатор не дает точную цену уровня; профиль помогает увидеть зону объема, но уровни должны проводиться по конкретным барам.","quote":"По индикатору чисто ориентироваться не нужно, он точную цифру не покажет, а мы проводим именно по определенным барам.","interpretation":"Volume profile is auxiliary context for range structure, not primary rule for exact levels.","confidence":0.86,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:22:34-01:25:10","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0181","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0182","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0183","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0184","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0185"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00108.jpg","time":"01:21:53"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00110.jpg","time":"01:23:47"}],"source_unit_count":5,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-024","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"accumulation","scenario":"paranormal_bar_after_channel","claim_type":"principle","tags":["atr_room","breakout","entry","exit","levels","risk"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Паранормальные бары чаще ожидаются при выходе из канала накопления, где в канале был сосредоточен объем и есть запас хода до следующего уровня; преподаватель предпочитает искать более ранний вход у нижней границы, когда видно, что ниже не пускают, а не гнаться за пробоем верхней границы.","quote":"При выходе из таких накоплений, там и начинаются сильные движения, паранормальные бары... я люблю... когда уже я вижу намеки на то, что вниз уже не пускают.","interpretation":"Channel exit and early accumulation entry become structural conditions for abnormal ATR movement.","confidence":0.84,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:25:10-01:31:34","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0186","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0187","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0188","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0189","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0190","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0191","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0192","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0193","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0194","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0195","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0196","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0197","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0198","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0199","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0200"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00112.jpg","time":"01:25:36"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00115.jpg","time":"01:28:19"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00120.jpg","time":"01:29:38"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00124.jpg","time":"01:31:34"}],"source_unit_count":15,"source_frame_count":4,"quote_sour