{"candidate_id":"MM-008-026","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"channel_trading","scenario":"middle_entry_exception","claim_type":"risk_rule","tags":["atr_room","entry","exit","levels","risk","stop"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Вход из середины канала допускается только при наличии локального уровня/точки входа и минимум 4 стопов расстояния до границы канала в сторону сделки; это нужно, чтобы сохранить математику минимум 3R после неидеального входа или выхода.","quote":"Если от середины канала вход, то как минимум до верхней границы канала должно быть минимум 4 стопа... минимум нам нужно брать... 3 к 1.","interpretation":"The 4-stop rule is a risk/reward buffer around a desired 3R trade.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:34:15-01:39:56","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0206","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0207","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0208","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0209","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0210","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0211","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0212","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0213","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0214","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0215","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0216","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0217","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0218","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0219"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00128.jpg","time":"01:34:43"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00131.jpg","time":"01:37:13"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00133.jpg","time":"01:39:00"}],"source_unit_count":14,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-008-027","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":8,"lecture_title":"урок 07","topic":"channel_trading","scenario":"boundary_to_boundary","claim_type":"risk_rule","tags":["entry","false_breakout","risk","stop"],"primary_tag":"entry","statement":"Торговля от одной границы канала до другой разрешается только при запасе хода минимум 8 стопов от входа до противоположной границы; для входа с середины большого канала достаточно минимум 4 стопов до целевой границы.","quote":"Если мы хотим зайти от нижней границы... до верхней границы канала должно быть минимум расстояние 8 стопов... если появилась точка входа с середины канала... минимум 4 стопа.","interpretation":"8-stop channel-width rule separates full channel trades from smaller middle-to-boundary opportunities.","confidence":0.9,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:39:56-01:44:28","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_008_7252f831","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_008_urok_07/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_008_7252f831_seg_0220","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0221","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0222","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0223","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0224","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0225","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0226","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0227","lec_008_7252f831_seg_0228"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00134.jpg","time":"01:39:56"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00138.jpg","time":"01:42:00"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00139.jpg","time":"01:43:00"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00140.jpg","time":"01:43:35"},{"path":"урок 07/frames/frame_00142.jpg","time":"01:45:02"}],"source_unit_count":9,"source_frame_count":5,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":fals