{"candidate_id":"MM-010-025","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"risk_management","scenario":"probability_and_stop_loss","claim_type":"principle","tags":["breakout","false_breakout","levels","retest","risk","stop","workflow"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"Ложный пробой является постфактумным явлением, трейдинг работает с вероятностями, и стоп-лосс нужен даже в setup с высокой вероятностью пробоя.","quote":"Ложный пробой это постфактумное явление... трейдинг - это вероятности... Для этого и существуют стоп-лоссы.","interpretation":"До возврата это не подтвержденный ЛП, а одна из веток вероятностного сценария.","confidence":0.91,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:54:57-01:01:16","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0127","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0130","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0131","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0135","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0138","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0139","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0140","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0141","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0142"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00090.jpg","time":"00:57:02"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00094.jpg","time":"01:01:14"}],"source_unit_count":9,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":0.9},"support_annotation_count":1,"support_gap_ids":["LEGACY-GAP-010-009"],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-026","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"entry_timing","scenario":"wait_false_breakout_no_reaction","claim_type":"preference","tags":["breakout","entry","false_breakout","levels","market_selection","retest"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"Преподаватель лично предпочитает не входить в первый пробой уровня без подтверждения, а ждать ложный пробой, откат и отсутствие нормальной реакции на него; это уменьшает количество сделок, но повышает качество.","quote":"Я всегда дождусь ложного пробоя, откат, а потом отсутствие реакции... меньше сделок, но они будут более качественные.","interpretation":"Это отмечено как personal algorithm option, а не единственно возможный стиль торговли.","confidence":0.84,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:55:16-01:00:25","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0128","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0129","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0136","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0137","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0140"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00090.jpg","time":"00:57:02"}],"source_unit_count":5,"source_frame_count":1,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-027","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"false_breakout","scenario":"wld_obvious_breakout_weak_reaction","claim_type":"example","tags":["breakout","exit","false_breakout","levels","market_selection","retest","risk","timeframes"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"В WLD-примере слишком очевидная пробойная картинка привела преподавателя к выходу из позиции; после ложного пробоя он интересуется только слабой реакцией вниз и возможным возвратом к уровню.","quote":"Очень явная картинка, где много кто хочет зайти... если нету резкого движения, оно вяло текущее идет... тогда я на нее уже буду смотреть.","interpretation":"Очевидность setup может быть фактором ловушки; после ЛП оценивается сила реакции, а не сам факт прокола.","confidence":0.86,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:01:19-01:04:27","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0143","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0144","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0145","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0146","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0147","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0148","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0149","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0150"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00096.jpg","time":"01:01:29"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00098.jpg","time":"01:02:48"}],"source_unit_count":8,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-028","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"stop_loss","scenario":"new_shorts_after_failed_long","claim_type":"mechanism","tags":["breakout","false_breakout","levels","retest","stop","timeframes"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"После failed breakout вверх бывшие лонгисты и новые участники могут зайти в short; их стопы за хвостом ложного пробоя становятся топливом для вероятного импульса вверх при возврате к уровню.","quote":"Перестали верить в рост и зашли здесь в шорт. Выставили стоп-лосс сюда... здесь уже более вероятный импульс.","interpretation":"Failed long setup can create a new short-stop pool, making later reclaim more explosive.","confidence":0.84,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:04:00-01:06:07","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0150","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0151","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0152","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0153","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0154"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00098.jpg","time":"01:02:48"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00101.jpg","time":"01:06:26"}],"source_unit_count":5,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-029","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"timeframe","scenario":"h1_local_execution_d1_context","claim_type":"principle","tags":["entry","levels","timeframes"],"primary_tag":"entry","statement":"Основная картина сейчас определяется на D1, но для входа внутри движения преподаватель использует H1 локальные уровни; эта тема отложена на конец курса.","quote":"Я входил не по дневному таймфрейму, я входил по часовику, там были локальные уровни... Сейчас самая важная нам дневка.","interpretation":"D1 sets context, H1 can refine execution later, но current level taxonomy строится с дневки.","confidence":0.84,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:06:07-01:08:00","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0155","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0156","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0157","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0158"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00102.jpg","time":"01:06:42"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00103.jpg","time":"01:07:24"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00104.jpg","time":"01:07:58"}],"source_unit_count":4,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-030","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"trading_style","scenario":"false_breakout_style","claim_type":"definition","tags":["atr_room","breakout","entry","false_breakout","levels","workflow"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Уровень не является непробиваемой стеной; торговля ложного пробоя названа одним из трех стилей торговли: ждать место, где должен быть импульс, но его нет, и входить в обратную сторону.","quote":"Уровень это не что-то такое золотое... Стили торговли... один из них ложный пробой... где должен быть импульс, а его нет.","interpretation":"ЛП является отдельным стилем, а не просто warning pattern.","confidence":0.87,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:09:14-01:11:13","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0162","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0163","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0164","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0165","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0166"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00107.jpg","time":"01:09:48"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00108.jpg","time":"01:10:20"}],"source_unit_count":5,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-031","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"false_breakout","scenario":"ton_two_bar_false_breakout_context","claim_type":"example","tags":["breakout","false_breakout","levels","timeframes","trend_context"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"В TON-примере уровень взят по бару, который остановил рост, затем дополнительное касание усилило уровень; долгий подход и отсутствие сильного движения вниз после пробоя создали контекст ложного пробоя двумя барами.","quote":"Это точка излома тренда... пришли еще раз, подтвердили наличие уровня... долго шли к уровню... тут должна быть паника, а ее нет.","interpretation":"Сильный уровень + long approach + missing panic reaction формируют high-interest false-breakout context.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:11:15-01:15:16","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0167","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0168","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0169","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0170","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0171","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0172","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0173","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0174","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0175","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0176","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0177"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00110.jpg","time":"01:11:35"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00111.jpg","time":"01:11:51"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00113.jpg","time":"01:13:27"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00115.jpg","time":"01:15:14"}],"source_unit_count":11,"source_frame_count":4,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-010-032","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":10,"lecture_title":"урок 09","topic":"level_strength","scenario":"touches_strengthen_level","claim_type":"principle","tags":["levels","trend_context"],"primary_tag":"levels","statement":"Дополнительное касание любого уровня в ту же цену усиливает уровень; чем ближе и чаще касания в одну цену, тем сильнее уровень.","quote":"Любое касание дополнительное в любой уровень... усиливает уровень. Чем больше касание в одну и ту же цену, тем сильнее уровень.","interpretation":"Touch count and touch precision become general level-quality features.","confidence":0.9,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:12:26-01:13:01; 01:39:26-01:39:52","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_010_de07310a","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_010_urok_09/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_010_de07310a_seg_0170","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0171","lec_010_de07310a_seg_0230"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00111.jpg","time":"01:11:51"},{"path":"урок 09/frames/frame_00151.jpg","time":"01:40:05"}],"source_unit_count":3,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
