{"candidate_id":"MM-011-006","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":11,"lecture_title":"урок 10","topic":"level_types","scenario":"paranormal_bar_level_recap","claim_type":"definition","tags":["atr_room","breakout","false_breakout","levels"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Паранормальный бар больше 1.8 ATR дает сильные уровни по low и high; в AMX-примере этот уровень затем усиливается ложным пробоем, касанием и проторговкой.","quote":"Все, что больше 1,8 АТР, то его низ и его верх являются сильными уровнями... касание... усилило уровень. Потом появилась проторговка.","interpretation":"Paranormal-bar level is previewed again but full nuances are deferred to a later lesson.","confidence":0.87,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:08:23-00:10:11; 00:16:28-00:16:59","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_011_6a80276d","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_011_urok_10/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0018","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0019","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0020","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0034"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00023.jpg","time":"00:08:28"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00025.jpg","time":"00:09:50"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00036.jpg","time":"00:16:36"}],"source_unit_count":4,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-011-007","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":11,"lecture_title":"урок 10","topic":"level_drawing","scenario":"choose_cluster_near_same_price","claim_type":"rule","tags":["levels"],"primary_tag":"levels","statement":"При выборе цены уровня нужно искать, где больше касаний максимально близко к одной и той же цене; AMX-зеркало иллюстрируется ценами около 0.5530-0.5531.","quote":"Надо смотреть, где больше всего касаний ближе всего, то есть к одной и той же цене... 55.31, 55.30.","interpretation":"Level placement is a precision/clustering task, not a broad approximate area by default.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:09:40-00:13:15","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_011_6a80276d","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_011_urok_10/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0020","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0021","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0022","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0023","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0024","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0025","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0026"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00026.jpg","time":"00:11:07"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00029.jpg","time":"00:11:58"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00030.jpg","time":"00:12:45"}],"source_unit_count":7,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-011-008","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":11,"lecture_title":"урок 10","topic":"level_recency","scenario":"nearest_fresh_level_priority","claim_type":"principle","tags":["levels","stop","trend_context"],"primary_tag":"levels","statement":"Для текущего решения сильнее и актуальнее ближайший сильный уровень к цене, потому что там свежие сделки и стопы; дальние уровни могут быть красивыми, но пока неактуальны.","quote":"Чем ближе к текущей цене уровень, тем он сильнее и он более актуальный... там стоят свежие стопы.","interpretation":"The bot/advisor should rank candidate levels by strength plus relevance to current price, not by historical beauty alone.","confidence":0.87,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:11:28-00:12:14; 00:35:22-00:36:18; 01:09:47-01:11:48","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_011_6a80276d","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_011_urok_10/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0023","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0024","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0075","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0076","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0149","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0151","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0152"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00029.jpg","time":"00:11:58"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00058.jpg","time":"00:36:01"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00108.jpg","time":"01:11:38"}],"source_unit_count":7,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":1,"support_gap_ids":["LEGACY-GAP-011-007"],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-011-009","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":11,"lecture_title":"урок 10","topic":"breakout_preconditions","scenario":"compression_only_near_level","claim_type":"setup_component","tags":["atr_room","breakout","levels","trend_context"],"primary_tag":"atr_room","statement":"Поджатие к уровню - rising lows and rising closes near a level - является предпосылкой к пробою, но такие признаки имеют смысл только у уровня, не в пустом месте.","quote":"Каждый лоу выше предыдущего... каждое закрытие выше предыдущего... это поджатие к уровню... можно рассматривать только у уровня.","interpretation":"Compression should be evaluated as level-relative structure, not as a standalone candle pattern.","confidence":0.88,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:13:15-00:15:28","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_011_6a80276d","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_011_urok_10/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0027","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0028","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0029","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0030","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0031"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00031.jpg","time":"00:13:20"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00033.jpg","time":"00:13:57"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00034.jpg","time":"00:15:00"}],"source_unit_count":5,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":1,"support_gap_ids":["LEGACY-GAP-011-001"],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
{"candidate_id":"MM-011-010","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":11,"lecture_title":"урок 10","topic":"entry_timing","scenario":"wait_for_daily_close_at_level","claim_type":"principle","tags":["entry","exit","levels"],"primary_tag":"entry","statement":"Когда цена подходит к уровню, нужно смотреть, как она подошла и как день закрылся относительно уровня; только после этого решается, торговать ли следующий день.","quote":"Надо смотреть, как она сюда подойдет, как день закроется относительно уровня. И после этого можно решать.","interpretation":"Daily close is the first decision checkpoint; the system should avoid entering before the closing context exists unless a later rule explicitly allows it.","confidence":0.9,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:15:57-00:17:30; 00:19:16-00:20:12","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_011_6a80276d","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_011_urok_10/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0033","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0034","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0035","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0040","lec_011_6a80276d_seg_0041"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00035.jpg","time":"00:16:02"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00039.jpg","time":"00:19:23"},{"path":"урок 10/frames/frame_00040.jpg","time":"00:19:55"}],"source_unit_count":5,"source_frame_count":3,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
