{"candidate_id":"MM-012-039","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":12,"lecture_title":"урок 11","topic":"false_breakout","scenario":"one_false_breakout_then_saw","claim_type":"rule","tags":["breakout","false_breakout","levels","saw"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"У одного уровня подряд может быть один ложный пробой в любой вариации: одним баром, двумя барами или сложный; повторные следующие проколы уже классифицируются как распил, а не новые ложные пробои.","quote":"Ложный пробой, он может быть один раз, просто в разных вариациях... любые последующие бары... это уже распил.","interpretation":"False-breakout detector should merge consecutive repeated pierces into saw/protorgovka state.","confidence":0.9,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:14:11-01:16:42","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_012_d50ffde1","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_012_urok_11/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_012_d50ffde1_seg_0151","lec_012_d50ffde1_seg_0152","lec_012_d50ffde1_seg_0153","lec_012_d50ffde1_seg_0154","lec_012_d50ffde1_seg_0155","lec_012_d50ffde1_seg_0156"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 11/frames/frame_00095.jpg","time":"01:14:31"}],"source_unit_count":6,"source_frame_count":1,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
