{"candidate_id":"MM-021-013","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":21,"lecture_title":"урок 18","topic":"multi_factor_prerequisites","scenario":"one_factor_not_enough_for_breakout","claim_type":"principle","tags":["breakout","false_breakout","levels"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"Для прогноза пробоя, ложного пробоя или отбоя одного фактора недостаточно; несколько факторов должны складываться возле сильного уровня.","quote":"предпосылки к пробою... не один фактор... закрытие вблизи уровня, этого достаточно... Нет, складывается несколько факторов вместе","interpretation":"Будущая модель направления должна быть факторной, а не основанной на одном признаке вроде close near level.","confidence":0.93,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:21:18-00:23:06","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_021_6ae7a243","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_021_urok_18/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0052","lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0053","lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0054","lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0055"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 18/frames/frame_00033.jpg","time":"00:21:36"},{"path":"урок 18/frames/frame_00034.jpg","time":"00:22:07"}],"source_unit_count":4,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
