{"candidate_id":"MM-021-037","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":21,"lecture_title":"урок 18","topic":"stop_market_for_false_breakout_short","scenario":"sell_below_level_on_return","claim_type":"entry_rule","tags":["breakout","entry","false_breakout","levels","retest","stop"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"Если уровень 100 пробит вверх, а ожидается ложный пробой, для шорта выставляется stop-market sell ниже уровня, например 99.99, чтобы войти только при возврате под уровень.","quote":"выставляется Stop Market Order сразу ниже уровня... уровень 100 долларов, то выставляем по 99,99... мы хотим шортить... только если цена вернется ниже","interpretation":"Stop-market используется как условный вход на обратный пробой, а не как обычный limit order.","confidence":0.95,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"01:16:09-01:18:01","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_021_6ae7a243","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_021_urok_18/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0177","lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0178","lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0179","lec_021_6ae7a243_seg_0180"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 18/frames/frame_00090.jpg","time":"01:16:18"},{"path":"урок 18/frames/frame_00091.jpg","time":"01:17:18"}],"source_unit_count":4,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
