{"candidate_id":"MM-022-011","candidate_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","status":"canonical_candidate_pool_member","review_status":"needs_later_source","course_position":22,"lecture_title":"урок 19","topic":"stop_market_automation","scenario":"avoid_missing_fast_breakout","claim_type":"execution_rule","tags":["breakout","entry","levels","market_selection","stop"],"primary_tag":"breakout","statement":"Stop-market нужен, чтобы не пропустить резкий пробой: когда цена достигает указанной отметки, заявка становится рыночной и открывает сделку автоматически.","quote":"заранее выставить ордер... автоматически, чтобы произошло открытие сделки по ближайшей цене... когда цена доходит до указанной цены... заявка превращается в рыночную.","interpretation":"Stop-market заменяет реакцию руками на заранее заданное условие.","confidence":0.94,"maturity":"observed_multimodal","source_time":"00:14:50-00:17:11","source_trace":{"source_kind":"observed_multimodal_claim","lecture_id":"lec_022_1b5e3300","source_file":"_knowledge_base/structured/lecture_pass/lectures/lecture_022_urok_19/claims_multimodal.jsonl","source_units":["lec_022_1b5e3300_seg_0030","lec_022_1b5e3300_seg_0031","lec_022_1b5e3300_seg_0032","lec_022_1b5e3300_seg_0033"],"source_frames":[{"path":"урок 19/frames/frame_00027.jpg","time":"00:16:00"},{"path":"урок 19/frames/frame_00029.jpg","time":"00:16:51"}],"source_unit_count":4,"source_frame_count":2,"quote_source_overlap":1.0},"support_annotation_count":0,"support_gap_ids":[],"candidate_pool_version":"canonical_candidate_pool_v1","execution_allowed":false,"canonical_rulebook_allowed":false}
